"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

#: deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df"
msgid "Muscle Camp"
msgstr "근육 캠프"

#: deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df"
msgid "Before camping for the night, "
msgstr "밤에 야영하기 전, "

#: deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df"
msgid ""
" has a full Olympic Style pose-down contest in front of a bunch of judges he"
" constructed out of garbage."
msgstr "은(는) 쓰레기로 만든 심사위원들 앞에서 올림픽 스타일 포즈다운 대회를 제대로 연다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df"
msgid " shows his entire bodybuilder posing routine off to "
msgstr "은(는) 보디빌더 포즈 루틴 전체를 보여 준다. 관객은 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df"
msgid ""
". His routine is incredible, without words it conveys a strong message of "
"hope and forgiveness. The group goes to sleep feeling pumped in a spiritual "
"sense."
msgstr ". 루틴이 엄청나다. 말 없이도 희망과 용서의 강한 메시지를 전한다. 일행은 영적으로 펌핑된 기분으로 잠든다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df"
msgid "Stalled Gains"
msgstr "정체된 근성장"

#: deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df"
msgid ""
" realizes that the promise of Canada really isn't doing much for his "
"physique. He makes a quick decision to abandon the entire mission."
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다라는 약속이 자기 몸매에 별 도움이 안 된다는 걸 깨닫는다. 그는 재빨리 임무 전체를 포기하기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df"
msgid ""
" yells something about his gains stalling. He starts walking away as he "
"yells something about nothing on this trip being swole. As far as "
msgstr "은(는) 근성장이 정체됐다고 소리친다. 이번 여행엔 우람한 게 하나도 없다고 외치며 걸어가 버린다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/tlb.df"
msgid " can guess, he's still yelling as he disappears over the horizon."
msgstr "이(가) 짐작하기로는, 그는 지평선 너머로 사라질 때까지 계속 소리쳤을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df"
msgid "It took long enough for that meal to happen."
msgstr "그 식사 하나 먹기까지 참 오래도 걸렸다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df"
msgid ""
" gets kicked out of the group!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이(가) 일행에서 쫓겨난다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df"
msgid "I can't believe this! How is that turkey even still alive?"
msgstr "말도 안 돼! 저 칠면조는 어떻게 아직도 살아 있는 거야?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df"
msgid "Turkey Fight"
msgstr "칠면조 싸움"

#: deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df"
msgid " pecks at "
msgstr "은(는) 쪼아 댄다. 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df"
msgid ""
" while making frantic gobbling noises!\r\n"
"\tIt looks like there's no compromise here.\r\n"
"\tEither the turkey goes or "
msgstr ""
". 미친 듯이 꾸룩거리면서!\r\n"
"\t타협의 여지가 없어 보인다.\r\n"
"\t칠면조가 떠나든지, 아니면 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df"
msgid " has to."
msgstr "이(가) 떠나야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df"
msgid "Get rid of Turkey"
msgstr "칠면조를 없앤다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df"
msgid "Kick "
msgstr "쫓아낸다: "

#: deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/turkey.df"
msgid " from team"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/siege/gasbar-region.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/gasbar-region.df"
msgid "GOT GAS?"
msgstr "기름 있어?"

#: deathforth/events/siege/region/mall.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/region/mall.df"
msgid "YEAH! THIS IS WHAT I TRAINED FOR!"
msgstr "좋아! 이걸 위해 훈련했지!"

#: deathforth/events/siege/region/mall.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/region/mall.df"
msgid "READY 2 ROCK!!!"
msgstr "준비 완료!!!"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege.df"
msgid "PHEW!"
msgstr "휴!"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege.df"
msgid ""
"The siege is over!\r\n"
"\tYou can now try to escape!"
msgstr ""
"포위전이 끝났다!\r\n"
"\t이제 탈출을 시도할 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege.df"
msgid "SIEGE!"
msgstr "포위전!"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Stash in the Woods"
msgstr "숲속의 은닉처"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " is driving through the forest at night. "
msgstr "은(는) 밤에 숲을 지나고 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid ""
" takes a wrong turn and hits the end of the road. Nearby to the north, "
msgstr "는 길을 잘못 들어 막다른 길에 닿는다. 북쪽 가까이에, "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " can barely see the shape of a cabin."
msgstr "는 오두막 형체를 간신히 알아본다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Investigate cabin"
msgstr "오두막을 조사한다"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "House Siege"
msgstr "주택 포위전"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " is surpised by a large horde of zombies while scavenging. "
msgstr "은(는) 물자를 뒤지다 큰 좀비 떼에 깜짝 놀란다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " run"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " into a house for shelter and to plan "
msgstr " 집 안으로 피신해 계획을 세운다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " next move."
msgstr " 다음 행동을."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:18 deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:26
#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:44 deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:53
#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Try to Survive"
msgstr "살아남아 본다"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Trapped in House"
msgstr "집에 갇히다"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " is about to explore a small house when "
msgstr "은(는) 작은 집을 탐색하려는데, "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:23 deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " notice"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " that a horde is creeping nearby. "
msgstr " 근처에 좀비 떼가 슬금슬금 다가오는 걸 알아챈다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " will have to hold "
msgstr "은(는) 버텨야 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " ground for a bit before "
msgstr " 자리를. 그래야 "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " can escape."
msgstr "이(가) 탈출할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Gas Station Siege"
msgstr "주유소 포위전"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " spots a gas station that looks fairly untouched. "
msgstr "은(는) 꽤 멀쩡해 보이는 주유소를 발견한다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid ""
" a horde close to the station. Checking it for loot would mean getting stuck"
" there for awhile."
msgstr " 주유소 근처의 좀비 떼를 알아챈다. 물자를 뒤지려면 한동안 거기 갇히게 될 거다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Fight the Siege"
msgstr "포위전을 치른다"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Cabin Siege"
msgstr "오두막 포위전"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " gets surrounded by an approaching horde. "
msgstr "은(는) 다가오는 좀비 떼에 포위된다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " seek shelter in a nearby cabin."
msgstr "은(는) 근처 오두막으로 피신한다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "1 Hour Cabin Vacation"
msgstr "오두막 1시간 휴가"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " gets confused when driving through a forest. "
msgstr "은(는) 숲을 지나다 길을 잃는다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " stop"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " at a cabin to figure out where "
msgstr " 오두막에 멈춰 위치를 파악하려 한다. 그런데 "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid ", but get"
msgstr "모두"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " trapped by a roaming horde."
msgstr " 떠도는 좀비 떼에 갇혀 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Camper in Distress"
msgstr "곤경에 빠진 야영객"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Driving along a rural road, "
msgstr "시골길을 달리던 중, "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid ""
" hears gunfire coming from a cabin in the distance. The forest near the "
"cabin ripples with the movement of an unseen horde."
msgstr "은(는) 멀리 오두막에서 총소리를 듣는다. 오두막 근처 숲이 보이지 않는 좀비 떼의 움직임으로 일렁인다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:62 deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:71
#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Attempt Rescue!"
msgstr "구출을 시도한다!"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Gassy Rescue"
msgstr "기름 냄새 나는 구출"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " is driving past a horde before it turns ugly, when "
msgstr "은(는) 좀비 떼가 험악해지기 전에 지나가던 중, "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " see a gas station. Someone is trapped inside."
msgstr "이(가) 주유소를 본다. 안에 누가 갇혀 있다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Roadside Rescue"
msgstr "길가 구출"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid ""
" sees a person fleeing into a rest stop, with a horde pursuing them. This "
"person could still be saved!"
msgstr "은(는) 좀비 떼에 쫓겨 휴게소로 도망치는 사람을 본다. 아직 구할 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Stuck in a Ditch"
msgstr "도랑에 빠지다"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "The car gets stuck in the ditch near a crappy dirt road. "
msgstr "형편없는 비포장도로 근처 도랑에 차가 빠진다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " is close to getting the car out when a roaming horde draws near. Now "
msgstr "은(는) 차를 거의 빼낼 즈음, 떠도는 좀비 떼가 다가온다. 이제 "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " must distract the zombies from getting too close."
msgstr "은(는) 좀비들이 너무 가까이 오지 못하게 주의를 돌려야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Final Siege on the Death Road"
msgstr "데스 로드의 마지막 포위전"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:96 deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Nearly at the border to Canada, "
msgstr "캐나다 국경을 코앞에 두고, "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:96 deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " is surrounded by seemingly endless undead. To survive, "
msgstr "은(는) 끝없어 보이는 언데드에게 포위된다. 살아남으려면, "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:96 deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " must face one last siege. "
msgstr "은(는) 마지막 포위전을 치러야 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:96 deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "This is the final siege, but not the last battle!"
msgstr "이건 마지막 포위전이지만, 마지막 전투는 아니다!"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:100 deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "ALL OR NOTHING!"
msgstr "모 아니면 도!"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "The Rough Morning"
msgstr "험난한 아침"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " leaves camp and is attacked by a gigantic wall of undead. "
msgstr "은(는) 야영지를 떠나다 거대한 언데드의 벽에 공격당한다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " forced to prepare for an all out battle. "
msgstr "모두 총력전을 준비해야 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "This is just the first siege of today!"
msgstr "이건 오늘의 첫 포위전일 뿐이다!"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Survive it!"
msgstr "살아남아라!"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:112 deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "City of Crushed Hopes"
msgstr "무너진 희망의 도시"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "After that huge siege, "
msgstr "그 거대한 포위전 이후, "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid ""
" was able to advance north towards the Canadian border. On the way is a city"
" filled with swarms of undead and the bleached bones of others who almost "
"made it."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 캐나다 국경을 향해 북쪽으로 나아갈 수 있었다. 가는 길에 언데드 떼와, 거의 다 왔던 이들의 하얗게 바랜 뼈로 가득한 도시가 "
"있다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Scavenge for ammo"
msgstr "탄약을 뒤진다"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:117
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Pass it by"
msgstr "지나친다"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Seek shelter in Cabin"
msgstr "오두막에 피신한다"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Hide out in House"
msgstr "집에 숨는다"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid "Close to the Border"
msgstr "국경 근처"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid ""
"Giant armies of undead perpetually lurch around the Canadian border, unable "
"to cross. "
msgstr "거대한 언데드 군대가 캐나다 국경 주변을 끝없이 비틀거리며 돌아다니지만, 건너오지는 못한다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " gets caught up in a lesser swarm before "
msgstr "은(는) 작은 좀비 무리에 휘말린다. 아직 "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege1.df"
msgid " can find a safe camp."
msgstr "이(가) 안전한 야영지를 찾기도 전에."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid "Mall of the Dead"
msgstr "죽은 자의 쇼핑몰"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " is driving through a ruined city when "
msgstr "은(는) 폐허가 된 도시를 지나다, "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " end"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " up being surrounded at all sides by a horde. "
msgstr " 사방에서 좀비 떼에 둘러싸이고 만다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " funneled into the only place that looks defendable: a ruined mall."
msgstr "모두 방어할 만한 유일한 곳으로 몰린다: 폐허가 된 쇼핑몰."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:8 deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:16
#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:24 deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:32
#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:40 deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid "Try to Survive"
msgstr "살아남아 본다"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid "Last Sale at Yallmart"
msgstr "얄마트 마지막 세일"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " tries to evade a large horde. Blocked by debris, "
msgstr "은(는) 큰 좀비 떼를 피하려 한다. 잔해에 막혀, "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " get"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " stuck in a Yallmart parking lot. "
msgstr " 얄마트 주차장에 갇힌다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " going to have to fight here for awhile."
msgstr "모두 여기서 한동안 싸워야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid "Tunnel Gauntlet"
msgstr "터널 돌파"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid ""
" accidentally disturbs a lot of undead while scouting a city. This causes a "
"chain reaction of blunders, and "
msgstr "은(는) 도시를 정찰하다 실수로 언데드를 잔뜩 깨운다. 그게 연쇄적인 실수로 이어져, "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " soon surrounded. "
msgstr "모두 곧 포위된다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " only chance is running through a tunnel in the road."
msgstr " 유일한 기회는 도로의 터널을 뚫고 달리는 것뿐이다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid "Caught in the Open"
msgstr "훤히 노출되다"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid ""
" runs into a section of city that has too much debris to drive through. "
"While "
msgstr "은(는) 잔해가 너무 많아 차로 지나갈 수 없는 구역에 들어선다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:29 deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " attempt"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:29 deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " to find a way past, a horde moves in. With nowhere to run, "
msgstr " 지나갈 길을 찾는 사이, 좀비 떼가 몰려온다. 도망칠 곳이 없어, "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " forced to fight on the street."
msgstr "모두 거리에서 싸울 수밖에 없다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid "Backs to the Wall"
msgstr "벽을 등지고"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " runs into a horde too thick to drive past, and gets cornered. "
msgstr "은(는) 차로 지나가기엔 너무 빽빽한 좀비 떼에 부딪혀 궁지에 몰린다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " run"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid ""
" for a good place to fight a siege, but the nearby buildings all look "
"ruined. "
msgstr " 포위전을 치를 좋은 장소를 찾지만, 근처 건물은 모두 폐허다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " in a bad spot to fight."
msgstr "모두 싸우기 나쁜 자리에 있다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid "Suburb Siege"
msgstr "교외 포위전"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid "From a distance, "
msgstr "멀리서, "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid ""
" sees some skeletons and loot in the middle of a debris-blocked street. "
msgstr "은(는) 잔해로 막힌 거리 한가운데 해골과 물자를 본다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " walk"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid ""
" over to get a closer look. This gets the attention of a horde of zombies "
"that rush out from all sides."
msgstr " 더 자세히 보려고 걸어간다. 이 때문에 사방에서 좀비 떼가 몰려나온다."

