msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid "Crossing The Viaduct"
msgstr "고가교 건너기"

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " runs into an old river viaduct whilst exploring on foot. While "
msgstr "은(는) 걸어서 탐색하다 낡은 강 고가교에 다다른다. "

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid " forced to attempt the perilous viaduct crossing."
msgstr "모두 위험천만한 고가교를 건너야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/siege/siege2.df"
msgid "Don't look back!"
msgstr "뒤돌아보지 마!"

