msgid "lizards"
msgstr "도마뱀"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:850
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid " and "
msgstr "이랑 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:850
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid "ice"
msgstr "얼음"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:850
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid ". A birthday plan turned awry?"
msgstr ". 생일 계획이 틀어졌나?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:853
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid ""
"The group is full.\r\n"
"\t\tWho would you like to replace to make room for "
msgstr ""
"일행이 꽉 찼다.\r\n"
"\t\t이 사람 자리를 만들려면 누구를 뺄까: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:858
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid " accepts "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:858
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid " to the team!"
msgstr "을(를) 일행으로 받아들인다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:868
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid "DEXTEROUS MORNING"
msgstr "재빠른 아침"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:870
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid ""
"SURPRISE, DINKFATHER! I wanted to surprise you. For your birthday. What do "
"you mean it's not your birthday?"
msgstr "서프라이즈, 얼간이 대부님! 놀라게 해 드리고 싶었어요. 생신이라서요. 생신이 아니라니 무슨 말씀이세요?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:871
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid ""
"Since this guy went to all that trouble to surprise you for your alleged "
"birthday, it might be a nice gesture to recruit him."
msgstr "이 사람이 너의 그 생일이라는 날을 위해 이렇게까지 애썼으니, 영입해 주는 게 예의일지도 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:872
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid "Cautiously recruit"
msgstr "조심스럽게 영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:873
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid "Leave him behind"
msgstr "두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:882
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid "really just wanted to surprise you, then the apocalypse happened."
msgstr "은(는) 그냥 너를 놀라게 해 주고 싶었는데, 그러다 종말이 왔다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:933
#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:966
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid "I'd need the masterkey to open it."
msgstr "이걸 열려면 마스터키가 필요해."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df:1059
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/harbour.df"
msgid "It's the harbour master key."
msgstr "항구 관리소 열쇠다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/mate_siege.df:695
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/mate_siege.df"
msgid "YIPPEE!"
msgstr "야호!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df"
msgid "The Way Out"
msgstr "탈출구"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df"
msgid ""
"You've found the exit to the parking lot. You can either leave the lot on "
"foot and return to your current car, or stay and take the car in the parking"
" lot."
msgstr "주차장 출구를 찾았다. 걸어서 주차장을 나가 지금 차로 돌아가거나, 남아서 주차장에 있는 차를 가져갈 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df"
