msgstr "지금 차로 돌아간다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df"
msgid "Let's Roll!"
msgstr "출발하자!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df"
msgid "This car isn't even locked, and is in pristine condition."
msgstr "이 차는 잠겨 있지도 않고, 상태도 완벽하다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df"
msgid "Don't enter the car unless you intend to drive away in it."
msgstr "몰고 떠날 생각이 아니면 차에 타지 마라."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df"
msgid "Get in the car"
msgstr "차에 탄다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df"
msgid "Leave it be for now"
msgstr "일단 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df:263
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df"
msgid "''PARKING FEE: 50 DOLLAR''"
msgstr "''주차 요금: 50달러''"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/multistory.df"
