msgid ", it IS suicide. Even though "
msgstr "에게는 정말로 자살 행위다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" is fairly strong, they'll never be as strong as a multi-tonne horde of "
"beese (plural for bison.)"
msgstr "가 꽤 강하긴 해도, 몇 톤짜리 들소 떼만큼 강할 순 없다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "...but "
msgstr "...하지만 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" is built different. As hardy and manical as any bison, they tear through "
"the horde one-by-one, suplexing and batting away several of the herd's "
"members."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차원이 다르다. 여느 들소만큼 튼튼하고 미쳐 날뛰며, 무리를 하나씩 찢어발기고, 여러 마리를 수플렉스로 꽂고 쳐 날린다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The herd disperses. They know their superior. They know the tale of the "
msgstr "무리가 흩어진다. 자기들보다 위인 존재를 알아본다. 그들은 이 전설을 안다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "MEGABUFF!!!"
msgstr "근육 괴물!!!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The group is able to get past, without even damaging their car!"
msgstr "일행은 차에 흠집 하나 없이 지나간다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Unfortunately, "
msgstr "안타깝게도, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " gets mauled pretty bad."
msgstr "은(는) 꽤 심하게 물어뜯긴다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " TRIUMPHS!?"
msgstr "이(가) 승리한다!?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "MAX STRENGTH INCREASED?!"
msgstr "최대 근력 증가?!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The car survives without damage, at least."
msgstr "그래도 차는 멀쩡하다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " stands atop of a footstool and proudly proclaims "
msgstr "은(는) 발 받침대 위에 서서 당당하게 발표한다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:66
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " speech: "
msgstr " 연설은 이렇다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " sits atop of a footstool and proudly yaps "
msgstr "은(는) 발 받침대 위에 앉아 당당하게 짖는다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"HI BISON PEOPLE. I THINK YOU SHOULD COOL IT. THAT WOULD BE AWESOME. I THINK."
msgstr "안녕 들소 여러분. 진정하는 게 좋을 것 같아. 그러면 정말 멋질 거야. 아마도."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:73
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"MOOO. MOOOOOO. HEY, WE'RE WALKIN' HERE. (American bison famously have urban "
"dialects.)"
msgstr "음머. 음머어어어. 어이, 우리 지금 걸어가잖아. (미국 들소는 도시 사투리로 유명하다.)"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Round the group the bison gather. This must be them... "
msgstr "들소들이 일행 주위로 모여든다. 이분이 틀림없어... "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "THE CHOSEN ONE"
msgstr "선택받은 자"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"(Bison tales speak of a chosen individual they are duty-bound to help! What "
"a rich and profound culture.)"
msgstr "(들소 설화에는 반드시 도와야 할 선택받은 자가 등장한다! 정말 풍부하고 심오한 문화다.)"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The bison carry the group to a nearby gas station! It's loaded with "
"supplies!"
msgstr "들소들이 일행을 근처 주유소까지 데려다준다! 물자가 가득하다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"To absolutely nobody's surprise, this doesn't work. How embarassing! Hours "
"pass before the car finally has enough space to get through."
msgstr "당연히 아무도 놀라지 않게, 이건 통하지 않는다. 창피하다! 몇 시간이 지나서야 차가 지나갈 공간이 생긴다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is able to remain calm despite the loud noises."
msgstr "은(는) 시끄러운 소리에도 침착함을 유지한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " FREAKS OUT! This is terrifying!"
msgstr "은(는) 기겁한다! 너무 무섭다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " shrieks like a child!"
msgstr "은(는) 어린애처럼 비명을 지른다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:117
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" decides to just book it through the horde. Herds and hordes aren't so "
"different, right?"
msgstr "은(는) 그냥 무리를 뚫고 달리기로 한다. 들소 떼나 좀비 떼나 그게 그거 아냐?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"Two bison are knocked out the way before the rest start to angrily maul the "
"car! Terror ensues."
msgstr "들소 두 마리가 튕겨 나가자, 나머지가 분노해서 차를 마구 들이받는다! 공포가 이어진다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tThe group survives, but not before hours of mauling. Eventually, the bison lose interest, and retreat back to whence they came."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t일행은 살아남지만, 몇 시간 동안 들이받힌 뒤에야. 결국 들소들은 흥미를 잃고 왔던 곳으로 돌아간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:130
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t...that could have been much, much worse!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t...훨씬, 훨씬 더 나쁠 수도 있었다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " thinks the whole experience was beautiful, in a way."
msgstr "은(는) 이 경험이 어떤 면에선 아름다웠다고 생각한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " hates waiting around! Waiting around is for dinks!"
msgstr "은(는) 기다리는 게 싫다! 기다리는 건 얼간이들이나 하는 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:146
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " waits so long they pee themselves!"
msgstr "은(는) 너무 오래 기다려서 바지에 지린다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:156
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" decides to sit in the car and just wait the herd out; simply let nature "
"take its course."
msgstr "은(는) 차 안에 앉아서 무리가 지나가길 기다리기로 한다. 그냥 자연에 맡기자."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:158
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Hours pass..."
msgstr "몇 시간이 지난다..."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:160
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "And then more hours pass..."
msgstr "그리고 또 몇 시간이 지난다..."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "...And even more. "
msgstr "...그리고 또. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" decides to go for a walk while the bison are crossing. Why spend all that "
"time waiting?"
msgstr "은(는) 들소가 건너는 동안 산책하기로 한다. 왜 그 시간을 다 기다리며 보내?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:173
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"There's fields and fields of bison. All in one line, all politely crossing "
"one-by-one."
msgstr "들판 가득 들소다. 전부 한 줄로, 한 마리씩 공손하게 건너고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"A few minutes after leaving their car, a bandit finds it and attempts to "
"break in. Leaving your car alone is a perilous decision!"
msgstr "차를 떠난 지 몇 분 뒤, 약탈자가 차를 발견하고 침입하려 한다. 차를 혼자 두는 건 위험한 결정이다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:187
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" had a bad feeling about this place and went to check up on the car half-way"
" through."
msgstr "은(는) 이곳에 대해 느낌이 안 좋아서 중간에 차를 확인하러 갔다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:188
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The carjacking is prevented! The bandit drops his crowbar and runs."
msgstr "차량 탈취를 막았다! 약탈자는 쇠지렛대를 떨어뜨리고 도망친다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandit breaks in!"
msgstr "약탈자가 침입한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " The entire car is prime for the taking!"
msgstr " 차 전체가 털리기 딱 좋은 상태다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"By walking around for a bit, the group find a location or two nearby. If "
"desired, they could loot the location while they wait."
msgstr "잠시 걸어 다니다 보니, 근처에 장소가 한두 곳 있다. 원하면 기다리는 동안 털 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Pick a new location to explore:"
msgstr "탐색할 새 장소를 고르세요:"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Rest Stop"
msgstr "휴게소"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:200
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Quiet Yallmart"
msgstr "조용한 얄마트"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:201
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Give up exploring"
msgstr "탐색을 포기한다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:212
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Wish We Had A Lasso"
msgstr "올가미가 있었으면"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" happens upon a herd crossing the road. The road is narrow and has hedges "
"and walls either side. Something must be done quickly; the bison herd is "
"already becoming "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 길을 건너는 들소 무리와 마주친다. 길은 좁고 양옆엔 산울타리와 벽이 있다. 빨리 뭔가 해야 한다. 들소 무리가 벌써 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "irate."
msgstr "화가 나고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:215
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Wait them out"
msgstr "지나갈 때까지 기다린다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": I'll take 'em!"
msgstr ": 내가 처리하지!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": TELL BISON TO COOL IT"
msgstr ": 들소에게 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:223
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": Calmly scare them away"
msgstr ": 침착하게 겁줘서 쫓는다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:226
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Run them over"
msgstr "치고 지나간다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:227
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Explore nearby on foot"
msgstr "걸어서 근처를 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "SCURVY-RIDDEN "
msgstr "괴혈병 걸린 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:238
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "TWINKLING "
msgstr "반짝반짝 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:239
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "BOTTOMFEEDER "
msgstr "바닥 청소부 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:240
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "LITTLE MAMA'S BOY "
msgstr "엄마 품에 안긴 아기 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "LANDGRUBBER "
msgstr "땅벌레 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:242
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "DINKFEST "
msgstr "얼간이 축제 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "TWO-TONGUE "
msgstr "두 혀 달린 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:244
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "POOPDECK SHIRTSTAIN "
msgstr "똥 갑판 셔츠 얼룩 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "DINGUS "
msgstr "멍청이 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "OBSERVER-UN-MEMBER-STATE "
msgstr "UN 옵서버 국가 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "GOATLICKIN' SWINE "
msgstr "염소나 핥는 돼지 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:248
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "PIGSTY "
msgstr "돼지우리 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "HORSEMOUTH "
msgstr "말 주둥이 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:250
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "COLDPLAY-ENJOYIN' "
msgstr "콜드플레이 즐겨 듣는 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "TIMES-TABLES STRUGGLING "
msgstr "구구단도 헤매는 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "SCRUNGLEBERRY "
msgstr "스크렁글베리 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:253
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "MOULDY TWITTER-POSTIN' "
msgstr "곰팡내 나는 트위터질 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:254
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "BITE-OF-87 VICTIM SON OF A "
msgstr "87년 깨물림 피해자의 자식 같은 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:255
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "COMPLETE FAILURE "
msgstr "완전한 실패작 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:256
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "OUTDATED GAME ENGINE "
msgstr "구닥다리 게임 엔진 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:257
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "SYCAMORE "
msgstr "시카모어 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:266
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" draws their weapons and demands the captain hand over his stuff. The "
"captain has other ideas."
msgstr "은(는) 무기를 뽑아 들고 선장에게 물건을 내놓으라고 한다. 선장은 생각이 다르다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:268
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"OH YOU SCURVY-RIDDEN TWINKLING LITTLE MAMA'S BOY DIRTY ROTTEN LANDGRUBBER "
"DINKFEST TWO-TONGUE POOPDECK SHIRTSTAIN OBSERVER-UN-MEMBER-STATE GOATLICKIN'"
" SWINE."
msgstr ""
"이런 괴혈병 걸린 반짝반짝 엄마 품의 아기 같은 더러운 땅벌레 얼간이 축제 두 혀 달린 똥 갑판 셔츠 얼룩 UN 옵서버 국가 염소나 핥는"
" 돼지 같으니라고."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"There is no competition. No resistance. This captain has a mouth like a "
"machine gun. "
msgstr "상대가 안 된다. 저항도 못 한다. 이 선장은 입이 기관총이다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:272
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't even want to carry on with the robbery anymore. These insults hurt "
"in places they didn't even know existed."
msgstr "은(는) 더 이상 털고 싶지도 않다. 이 욕설들은 존재하는지도 몰랐던 곳까지 아프게 한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:276
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" has a crisis. Was this the sum of their entire life? Is this all they are? "
"Had the skeleton been right, all along?"
msgstr "은(는) 위기에 빠진다. 이게 내 인생의 전부였나? 나는 고작 이런 존재인가? 해골이 처음부터 옳았던 걸까?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:279
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The survivors of this VERBAL BOMB decide to flee before the captain can undo"
" their egos any further."
msgstr "이 언어 폭탄의 생존자들은 선장이 자존심을 더 박살 내기 전에 도망치기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:284
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" launches at the undead creature with their weapons! Fragile knuckles be "
"damned! "
msgstr "은(는) 무기를 들고 언데드에게 달려든다! 연약한 손가락 마디 따위 알 게 뭐야! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Skeletons are for losers! Also, I WANT YOUR HAT!"
msgstr "해골은 찐따나 되는 거야! 그리고, 그 모자 내놔!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:291
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" fights the skeleton, tearing it limb from limb! Bones crack on both sides! "
"The fight is intense. "
msgstr "은(는) 해골과 싸우며 사지를 찢어발긴다! 양쪽 다 뼈가 부러진다! 치열한 싸움이다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" emerges victorious! The captain's hat is plucked from the viscera, along "
"with other valuables."
msgstr "이(가) 승리한다! 잔해 속에서 선장 모자와 다른 귀중품을 건져 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" fights the skeleton! It's not close. This captain is a seasoned combat "
"veteran! Those boney fingers hurt!"
msgstr "은(는) 해골과 싸운다! 상대가 안 된다. 이 선장은 노련한 전투 베테랑이다! 그 앙상한 손가락이 아프다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:314
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " yelps so loudly that nearby glass shatters. "
msgstr "은(는) 너무 크게 비명을 질러 근처 유리가 깨진다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:316
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "BEGONE WITH YE, FICKLE, FRAIL FLESHLING!"
msgstr "꺼져라, 변덕스럽고 연약한 살덩이야!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:319
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"And for most fights, that would be the end of it. Rather than let the "
"captain get away, however, "
msgstr "보통 싸움이라면 여기서 끝났을 거다. 하지만 선장이 도망가게 두는 대신, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:319
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " spies an opportunity."
msgstr "은(는) 기회를 엿본다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:320
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" grabs a nearby rock and lobs it squarely at the captain's head! The captain"
" falls over into a limp pile."
msgstr "은(는) 근처 돌을 집어 선장 머리에 정통으로 던진다! 선장이 축 늘어져 쓰러진다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:321
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The House of Undead Skeleton Fights would ordinarily look down upon such a "
"timid victory, but this is the apocalypse. Who cares? Free loot!"
msgstr "언데드 해골 결투 협회는 보통 이런 비겁한 승리를 깔보겠지만, 지금은 종말이다. 누가 신경 써? 공짜 물자다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" decides to ask about the DANDY BONES FOOT LOCKER that they'd heard so much "
"about. "
msgstr "은(는) 소문이 자자한 '멋쟁이 해골 사물함'에 대해 물어보기로 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:342
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"ARH, SO YOU BE WANTING TO KNOW MY TALE? I'VE SEEN THE LOCKER MY LAD. NAE, I "
"OWN IT. COMMON MISCONCEPTION ABOUT THE LOCKER: TIS ACTUALLY MY WEBSITE. I "
"SETS IT UP MYSELF SO I DID. TIS THE FINEST WEBSITE IN ALL THE ATLANTIC "
"OCEAN, WHICH IS NOT AS IMPRESSIVE NOW I SAY IT ALOUD. I BE SELLIN' KOREAN "
"POP MUSIC. VERY POPULAR DOWN THERE! I MAKE A KILLIN' OFF IT TOO. ALL ILLEGAL"
" OBVIOUSLY, BUT WHO'S TO STOP ME? I'M TEN BILLION FEET UNDER THE FLOOR ME "
"HEARTY. NO POLICE DOWN THERE."
msgstr ""
"아르, 내 이야기가 듣고 싶다고? 그 사물함 봤지, 젊은이. 아니, 내가 주인이야. 사물함에 대한 흔한 오해: 사실 그건 내 웹사이트다."
" 내가 직접 만들었지. 대서양 전체에서 제일 좋은 웹사이트야. 말로 하니까 별로 대단하게 안 들리네. 난 케이팝을 팔아. 저 아래선 엄청"
" 인기지! 아주 떼돈을 벌고 있어. 당연히 다 불법이지만, 누가 날 막겠어? 난 해저 백억 피트 아래에 있다고, 친구. 거긴 경찰도 "
"없어."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:344
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" KILLING ISN'T THAT MUCH FUN. NOT AS FUN AS JPOP OR KPOP. YOU SHOULD TRY "
"BOTH AT ONCE. I RECOMMEND IT. ANYWAY, JPOP. NO. KPOP. WANT MY ADVICE? OPEN A"
" KPOP STORE. THEN OPEN A REGULAR POP STORE. THAT'S CALLED BRANDING."
msgstr ""
" 죽이는 건 별로 재미없어. 제이팝이나 케이팝만큼 재밌진 않지. 둘 다 동시에 해 봐. 강추야. 아무튼, 제이팝. 아니. 케이팝. 조언 "
"하나 해 줄까? 케이팝 가게를 열어. 그다음엔 그냥 팝 가게를 열고. 그게 브랜딩이란 거야."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:346
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"Months later, long, long after the group is gone, the skeleton captain is "
"still ranting about his website. He's been set in motion, and he won't stop "
"until the last syllable of recorded time."
msgstr ""
"몇 달 뒤, 일행이 떠난 지 한참 지나서도 해골 선장은 아직 자기 웹사이트 이야기를 늘어놓고 있다. 한번 시동이 걸리면, 시간의 마지막 "
"음절까지 멈추지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:347
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Who knows how long they might've been there otherwise?"
msgstr "안 그랬으면 거기 얼마나 붙잡혀 있었을지 누가 알겠어?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:350
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "COOL WEBSITE BRO"
msgstr "웹사이트 멋지다 형"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:353
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"AYE. TIS A SAD TALE. I WAS SUNK IN ME PRIME. ALAS, TIS THE WAY IT GOES. "
"MAYBE IT WASN'T FOR ME. "
msgstr "그래. 슬픈 이야기지. 난 한창때 가라앉았어. 아아, 세상이 다 그렇지. 나랑은 안 맞았나 봐. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:354
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "BUT MAYBE IT'LL BE FOR YOU. YOU KNOW WHAT? HAVE THIS."
msgstr "하지만 너희한텐 맞을지도 몰라. 그거 알아? 이거 가져가."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:356
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The captain gives the group a spare weapon as thanks for listening to him!"
msgstr "선장이 이야기를 들어 준 보답으로 여분 무기를 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "PISTOL GET!"
msgstr "권총 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "SHOTGUN GET!"
msgstr "산탄총 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:371
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "DOLT GET!"
msgstr "돌트 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:374
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "RIFLE GET!"
msgstr "소총 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:382
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " decides to ask how the submarine sank. "
msgstr "은(는) 잠수함이 어떻게 가라앉았는지 묻기로 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:384
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"WELL, IT'S A LONG STORY. TO CUT IT SHORT, I POOPED MY PANTS REAL BAD. DON'T "
"LAUGH. I SEE YOU LAUGHING. ARGH."
msgstr "음, 얘기가 길어. 짧게 말하면, 바지에 엄청 싸 버렸어. 웃지 마. 웃는 거 다 보여. 아르."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:389
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "HA. HAHAHAHA. LOSER. sorry."
msgstr "하. 하하하하. 루저. 미안."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" learns a valuable but honestly only vaguely related lesson in naval "
"warfare...and shooting!"
msgstr "은(는) 해전과... 사격에 대해, 소중하지만 솔직히 별 관련 없는 교훈을 얻는다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:393
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " silently wonders where the submarine is now."
msgstr "은(는) 잠수함이 지금 어디 있을지 조용히 궁금해한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:410
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " tells the submarine captain to "
msgstr "은(는) 잠수함 선장에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:410
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "COOL IT..."
msgstr "진정해..."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:412
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " just kinda makes a series of whines. The captain understands."
msgstr "은(는) 그냥 낑낑거리는 소리를 연달아 낸다. 선장은 알아듣는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:415
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"COOL IT YE SAY? WHAT, LIKE ICE? GOOD IDEA. WE CAN COOL IT AT MY HIDEOUT. "
"YARGH."
msgstr "진정하라고? 뭐, 얼음처럼? 좋은 생각이군. 내 은신처에서 진정하자고. 야르."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:416
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The captain invites the group to his personal hideout and offers them "
"drinks! This is great!"
msgstr "선장이 일행을 자기 은신처로 초대해 마실 것을 내준다! 정말 좋다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:418
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"I'VE TOLD PEOPLE TO COOL IT MY WHOLE LIFE. THE MOMENT I DO, THEY STOP BEING "
"FRIENDS. COULDN'T POSSIBLY KNOW WHY. YARGH."
msgstr "난 평생 사람들한테 진정하라고 했지. 그 말만 하면 다들 친구 관계를 끊더라고. 왜 그런지 도무지 모르겠어. 야르."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:419
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"How tragic. After a few hours of relaxing and talking, they say their "
"farewells and head back onto their journey."
msgstr "참 비극이다. 몇 시간 쉬며 이야기를 나눈 뒤, 작별 인사를 하고 다시 여정을 떠난다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:422
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "YARRRGGHHHHHH!!! WAIT! WAITTTT!!!"
msgstr "야르르르르르르!!! 기다려! 기다려어어!!!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:423
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"As the group exits, the captain chases after them, captain's hat in-hand."
msgstr "일행이 떠나려 하자, 선장이 선장 모자를 손에 들고 쫓아온다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:424
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "HERE. TAKE THIS. YOU'RE THE FIRST FRIENDS I'VE HAD IN DECADES."
msgstr "자. 이거 받아. 수십 년 만에 처음 생긴 친구들이야."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:425
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " puts the hat on. They feel strangely more powerful!"
msgstr "은(는) 모자를 쓴다. 이상하게 더 강해진 기분이다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:428
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "MAX STRENGTH & VITALITY INCREASED!"
msgstr "최대 근력 & 생명력 증가!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:455
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " asks if the captain would like to trade. He proposes an offer: "
msgstr "은(는) 선장에게 거래하겠냐고 묻는다. 그가 제안한다: "
